 "title": "Auditor / Vigo County, Indiana",
 "text": "Auditor / Vigo County, Indiana\nSkip over navigation\nVigo County, Indiana\nSearch\nSubmit\n-->\nMenu\nCounty Offices \nCommissioners  Meeting Center\nARPA\nCouncil\nArea Planning  Apply for a Permit\nRezoning\nSubdivisions\nBoard of Zoning Appeals\nPlan Commission\nFloodplain Information\nAgendas and Minutes\nAssessor\nAuditor\nBuilding Inspections\nClerk  Elections\nMarriage\nConvention and Visitors\nCoroner\nExtension Service\nHarrison Township Assessor\nHealth Department  Environmental Health\nHealth Clinic\nHealth Education\nVector\nVital Statistics\nHighway Department\nHuman Resources  Employee Benefits\nEmployment/Jobs\nNews and Announcements\nPolicies\nInformation Technology\nPark Department\nRecorder\nRedevelopment  Industrial Park\nSoil and Water  NRCS\nSolid Waste Management\nSurveyor  Access Cover Project\nBruce W. Allen Jr.\nOriginal Government Surveys\nRegulated Legal Drains\nReport Damaged Section Corners\nState Line Marker\nStone Perpetuation Program\nUser Disclaimer\nStone Database\nTreasurer\nVeteran's Assistance\nVoter Registration\nWeights & Measures\nCourthouse \nCASA\nClerk  Child Support\nCivil Filings\nCourt Records\nCourts  Indiana Legal Help\nDrug Court\nIV-D Court\nJury Administration\nJuvenile Division\nProbate Division\nSuperior Court 1\nSuperior Court 2\nSuperior Court 3\nSuperior Court 4\nSuperior Court 5\nSuperior Court 6\nVeterans Court\nHomes for Children\nJuvenile Center\nProsecutor  Adult Protective Services\nAlcohol/Drug Prosecution\nCheck Deception\nChild Support\nChild Support Division\nCrime Victim Assistance Program\nCriminal\nCriminal Division\nDomestic Violence\nInfraction Deferrals\nHigh Tech Crime Unit\nPublic Defender\nTaxes\nPublic Safety \nCourt Services  Adult Probation\nCommunity Corrections\nJuvenile Probation\nPre-Trial Services\nDrug Task Force\nEmergency Management\nEnhanced 911\nFire Investigation\nPrevention\nSheriff\nHow Do I? \nBrowse the County Staff\nConnect with Vigo County on Social Media\nContact a Township Trustee\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nFind a Service\nReport a Pothole or other Road Hazard\nSubmit a Request\nView County Ordinances\nView FAQs\nView a Slideshow\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Agendas\nForms & Applications\nJob Postings\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nRelated Pages\nStart Content\nSearch\nSubmit\nHome\nGovernment\nAuditor\nAuditor\nThe Auditor of Vigo County is responsible for keeping all financial records for the County.\nDuties include, but not limited to:\nProcess payroll for all county employees.\nProcess all County Accounts Payable, including vendor claims.\nPrepare w-2's & 1099's.\nOfficial keeper of minutes, ordinances, contracts and bonds.\nAdministration & Reporting of all County Grants.\nCalculate property tax rates based on assessed values and budget needs.\nProcess property tax corrections & refunds.\nConduct the Bi-Annual County Property Tax Sales, per State Code, on all property that become delinquent by 3 tax payments or more.\nProcess property transfers, parcel splits, combinations & annexations.\nThe fee for the Vigo County Auditor to convey property is ten dollars ($10) per parcel.\nAs of July 2021, the fee per sales disclosure is twenty dollars ($20).\nThe current Vigo County Auditor is Larry T Hutchings II.\nFor any questions the Auditor may be contacted at ( 812 ) 462-3361.\nNews\nRelated Pages\nServices\nRecent News\nLocal Income Tax Resolution 2026-3 Notice to Taxpayers\nRevised Tax Sale 2026 Advertisement\n2026 Tax Sale Handout\n2026 Tax Sale\nBudget Hearings 8.12.26 - 8.14.26\nMore Recent News\nRelated Pages\nIRS W9 Form\nCouncil Meeting Agenda - April 12, 2011\nAffidavit for Issuance of Duplicate Warrant (Check)\nFirst Payroll Plus Application\nFirst Payroll Plus\nServices\nAgendas & Minutes\nCounty Code\nContact Us\nLarry Hutchings ,\nVigo County Auditor\n131 Oak St\nTerre Haute, IN 47807 Get Directions\nPhone: (812) 462-3361\nEmail Us\nStaff Directory\nHours: Monday thru Friday 8a-4p\nClosed on all Government Recognized Holidays\nMore Information\nFind content and services related to this page.\nAction Center\nDocument Center Agendas\nBreaking News\nFAQs\nForms & Applications\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nOrdinances\nPayable Claims\nPublic Documents\nLocations\nServices Index\nJump to a content archive Make a Selection Locations Action Center Document Center\n- Forms & Applications\n- News & Notices\n- FAQs\n- Public Documents\n- Minutes\n- Agendas\n- Breaking News\n- Ordinances\n- Payable Claims Services Index\n© 2026 Vigo County, Indiana\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms of Use\nLegal Center\nSite Design and Content Management by\nCore Business Technologies\nPhotography by: Brendan Kearns",
